   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Magazine clean: median ~125, bright clean whites (228,224,215 / p99 ~251), cool-magenta shadows (33,28,34 / hue 290), red 28% with aqua 19% / blue 11% / magenta 10%, saturation 0.28, clean skin (hue 20 / sat 0.35). Best for: Cover-style bridal and fashion portraits, white and pastel studio backgrounds, clean jewellery and couture frames, bright editorial couple portraits.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
